# Essential tracked files in this repo:
#   project.godot, main.tscn, "Play Darkiron.cmd",
#   scripts/*.gd + scripts/*.gd.uid,
#   tests/*.gd + tests/*.gd.uid, tests/performance-*.json,
#   assets/mountains.jpg + assets/mountains.jpg.import,
#   assets/darkiron-rig.png + assets/darkiron-rig.png.import (retained reference, see README),
#   README.md, PRINCE-REVIEW.md, assets/GENERATION.md
# Everything below is regenerable, unused, or local-only.

# --- Godot generated cache (recreated on editor import / run) ---
.godot/

# --- Generated renderer captures (recreate via `-- --capture` / `-- --visual`, see README) ---
# ~58 MB total; includes preview.png and all preview-*.png test snapshots.
/preview.png
/preview.png.import
/preview-*.png
/preview-*.png.import

# --- Unused / redundant reference art at repo root ---
# Scenery already ships as assets/mountains.jpg (byte-for-byte copy of
# distant_Paralax.png). None of these are preload()ed by scripts/*.gd.
# Import mode is deliberately "keep", so only the stub .import files exist.
/Background.png
/Background.png.import
/Darkiron.png
/Darkiron.png.import
/distant_Paralax.png
/distant_Paralax.png.import
/Enemy.png
/Enemy.png.import

# --- Godot logs, temp files, and test output ---
*.tmp
*.log
test-output.log

# --- Export / build outputs (never commit binaries) ---
/builds/
/export/
/exports/
*.pck
*.exe
*.zip
export_templates/

# --- OS and editor leftovers ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

